# Test fixtures are byte-exact inputs. A checkout must never rewrite their line
# endings: `core.autocrlf = true` turns an LF inside a `pss_msg.bin` into CRLF,
# which silently invalidates the signature made over it, and the result looks
# like broken cryptography rather than a git setting — the fixture was fine, its
# working-tree copy was not.
src/protocol/tls13/testdata/** -text
*.der -text
